{"title":"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems\">2005 AMC 12B #10</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems\">2005 AMC 10B #11</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_10\">Problem 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first term of a sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/5/9f5b442c275b4324f100c365b774e872b6b21f1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2005$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />. Each succeeding term is the sum of the cubes of the digits of the previous term. What is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/2/582ea0f3eb219a104673436f686669ef5d1bffb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${2005}^{\\text{th}}$\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> term of the sequence?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/0/d00b9ff41be47e2eca3b0899b8060b799f2066b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)} 29 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)} 55 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)} 85 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)} 133 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)} 250$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"378\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Performing this operation several times yields the results of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/0/9501915f08ed1cf295fdd389481801277bcb2e94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$133$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> for the second term, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> for the third term, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/8/448b3c8f2596d1b93b4b3ef199f8b3241ced9da2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$250$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> for the fourth term. The sum of the cubes of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/8/448b3c8f2596d1b93b4b3ef199f8b3241ced9da2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$250$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/0/9501915f08ed1cf295fdd389481801277bcb2e94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$133$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, a complete cycle. The cycle is, excluding the first term, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/d/dbdd606f9a293cef748b15755d8d0991765f38bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{\\text{nd}}$\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/8/1c829ec23ba9c6994a639da67d878e22d151a7ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{\\text{rd}}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/4/7c402a8d37bae8bb31fa855956ad7c2303549ecd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{\\text{th}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"16\" /> terms will equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/0/9501915f08ed1cf295fdd389481801277bcb2e94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$133$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/8/448b3c8f2596d1b93b4b3ef199f8b3241ced9da2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$250$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, following the fourth term. Any term number that is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/b/07bdc1cc8efa7f7f1c736c4efad05c7c7cac3db3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\ (\\text{mod}\\ 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> will produce a result of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/8/448b3c8f2596d1b93b4b3ef199f8b3241ced9da2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$250$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. It just so happens that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/a/b3a7db1aee1d70559b3a4527151341eb6ae2887b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2005\\equiv 1\\ (\\text{mod}\\ 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />, which leads us to the answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/e/d8efd78c61b0c5abb3e340788350e4b23573b29d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 250}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"74\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B\">2005 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem